MID_MV30_00: <SH>
MID_MV30_00_m001: Ti maledico... per avere osato\nmetterti contro di me!
MID_MV30_00_m002: È intollerabile!
MID_MV30_00_m003: (growling sounds)
MID_MV30_00_m004: (small grunt of determination)
MID_MV30_00_m005: (charging growl)
